covariate that affects both \code{CL} and \code{Q} through the same theta).
\item RHS \code{COVARIATE}: The first (positional) argument. The bare,
unquoted name of a \code{contcov}/\code{catcov} column (see \code{\link[xpose:xp_var]{xpose::xp_var()}}) --
\emph{not} a fixed-effect or omega selector.
\item RHS \code{THETA...}: One or more further positional arguments,
